SQLarius: You made it. This is the Rootyard — empty most days now, it used to be full of knowledge seekers before the hackers came.
SQLarius: We have 4 Buildings here. P-Building, L-Building, M-Building, and lastly where the hackers are hiding the D-Building.
SQLarius: We need to get the keys from the first three building, when you get the first key from the P-Building which is [color=blue]The Blue Key [/color]
SQLarius: You will be able to go to the next building. And from there the same thing. Until we get the [color=red]Red Key[/color]
SQLarius: Then you will be able to go the D-Building where they have my powers stored. And we will retrieve it.
[signal arg="move"]